# Open large assemblies (JD-scale companions)

Opening a Top Level / large Creo assembly must materialize **all Creo-openable companions** the model needs (thousands OK). A broken Retrieve with a thin local workspace is a regression.

## Do not reintroduce

| Anti-pattern | Why it hurt |
|---|---|
| Discard Where Used when `len > 120` (“noisy index”) | JD Open got ~23 files; vault-scan capped at 150 |
| Trust sparse Where Used (`1…79`) and skip vault-scan | Thin post-zip index looked “good enough” |
| Cap DB Where Used walk at 150 / depth 8 | Truncated deep trees (~2748 of 4022) |
| Magnet prune asm parents `> 40` | Wiped real shared JD sub-asms |
| Fixed `90_000` ms `CreoJS.openModel` / short outer Open budget | “session may be offline” while Retrieve still running after materialize |
| Materialize vault tips during **Finding dependencies…** | Wedged QueuePool / hung the site |
| Toolkit `OpenFile`/`RetrieveModel` before File > Open trail | JD workspace File → Open was quiet; Toolkit path flooded retrieval/regen messages |
| Disk-Retrieve for metadata right after Embedded Open | Re-ran the noisy Toolkit path after trail already opened the model |
| Set Creo WD on every Embedded Open by default | Locks the local workspace folder (WinError 32 on Delete product / remove-folder); File > Open trail is enough |
| `openAsmAsMfg` / Toolkit `OpenFile(MDL_MFG)` before File > Open trail | Flashes a window; can break combine-state / group regen on normal `.asm` opens |

## Required behavior

1. **`CreoService._dependencies_for`** — Prefer Where Used DB BFS (`_MAX_DEP_DEPENDENCIES` ≥ 4000, depth ≥ 32). Vault-scan when empty/sparse (`_SPARSE_OPEN_WHERE_USED`). When a large WU tree is still short of product siblings, **product-fill every remaining vault tip** (`len(chosen) < len(companion_siblings)` — all objects except the primary, same set zip/Add stored; never filter fill through `is_creo_openable` alone). Never `_MAX_OPEN_FROM_WHERE_USED` discard.
2. **Magnet prune** — `_MAX_WHERE_USED_ASM_PARENTS` stays high enough for shared sub-asms (200+); only drop true name-table magnets.
3. **`app.js`** — `creoOpenModelTimeoutMs(preparedDependencyCount(…))` and a generous `openWorkTimeoutMs` for prepare + zip + open. No fixed 90s on vault Open. After Open, metadata is **session-only** (wait for model; no disk-Retrieve). Soft-refresh Files when Open metadata saves. Embedded Open does **not** set Creo WD by default (chooser checkbox / toolbar only).
4. **`base.html` `openModel`** — Prefer File > Open trail (`creoTryOpenViaTrail`) for native Creo tips before `OpenFile`/`RetrieveModel`; Assembly type (`db_1`) for `.asm`; on-disk basename for Inputname; `openAsmAsMfg` only after trail + Retrieve fail; ChangeDirectory only on Toolkit fallback.
5. **Agent** — Materialize only the prepare list; Finding deps must **locate** only (no server `materialize(` in `_dependencies_for`).

## Tests (keep green)

- `tests/unit/test_open_large_assembly_contract.py` — single contract for the anti-patterns above
- `tests/integration/test_creo_open.py` — `test_open_dependencies_trust_large_where_used_tree`, `test_open_dependencies_sparse_where_used_falls_back_to_vault_scan`
- Docs: Open row in `docs/user-interactions.md` (fill companions + long Creo wait + File > Open trail + WD default-off)

```text
# ❌ BAD — if len(chosen) > 120: chosen = []
# ❌ BAD — openModel(..., 90000, "session may be offline")
# ❌ BAD — _MAX_WHERE_USED_ASM_PARENTS = 40
# ❌ BAD — OpenFile/Retrieve before trail for native Embedded Open
# ❌ BAD — setWorkingDirectory: hostedCreoJS() / showWd on skip-chooser by default
# ✅ GOOD — trust large WU + product-fill + File > Open trail + WD opt-in only + creoOpenModelTimeoutMs(deps)
```
